SUMMARY:[WEEK 6] Thursday: Whizlabs Networking Lab - Load Balancer
DESCRIPTION:Week 6 Hands-On Lab - New Year Week (Flexible)\n\n🏗️ Lab Objective:\n- Create VMs in same availability set\n- Configure Azure Load Balancer (Layer 4)\n- Set up health probes\n- Configure session persistence\n- Test failover & traffic distribution\n- Compare with Application Gateway (Layer 7)\n\n⏱️ Estimated time: 1.5-2 hours\n📋 Adjust timing if needed\n\n✅ Completion: LB distributing traffic correctly
