SUMMARY:[WEEK 7] Thursday: Whizlabs Backup/DR Lab
DESCRIPTION:Week 7 Hands-On Lab\n\n🏗️ Lab Objective:\n- Configure VM backup (Recovery Services Vault)\n- Set backup policy (retention, schedule)\n- Test restore options (files, disk, full VM)\n- Understand RTO (Recovery Time Objective)\n- Understand RPO (Recovery Point Objective)\n- Configure cross-region replication\n- Calculate RTO/RPO for scenarios\n\n⏱️ Estimated time: 1.5-2 hours\n\n✅ Completion: Successfully restore a VM disk from backup
LOCATION:Azure Portal - Hands On
